# BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore from next to the Dockerfile. Paths
# are relative to the build context, which is the parent directory (see the
# Dockerfile header). Exclude everything except the two modules we need.
*
!NextDuel
!nex-server

**/.git
**/node_modules
NextDuel/nextduel-frontend/dist
NextDuel/nextduel-svr/*.db*
NextDuel/nextduel-svr/sessions
NextDuel/nextduel-svr/tmp
NextDuel/nextduel-svr/bin
**/.env
